sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Rec as Receptionist
    participant MVC as ReceptionistAppointmentController
    participant API as AppointmentsController
    participant Svc as AppointmentService
    participant DB as SQL Server

    Rec->>MVC: GET /Receptionist/Appointments/Review/{id}
    MVC->>API: GET /api/receptionist/appointments/{id}/available-dentists
    API->>Svc: Query active Dentists, Rooms (Status='Active'), DentalChairs (Status='Active')
    DB-->>MVC: Eligible Dentists, Rooms & Chairs

    Rec->>MVC: POST /Receptionist/Appointments/Confirm/{id} (DentistId, RoomId, ChairId)
    MVC->>API: POST /api/receptionist/appointments/{id}/confirm
    API->>Svc: ReceptionistConfirmAsync(id, recUserId, request)
    Svc->>DB: Verify Dentist not on approved leave & Chair belongs to Room (UQ_DentalChairs_RoomId_ChairId)
    Svc->>DB: UPDATE Appointments SET Status='Confirmed'
    Svc->>DB: UPDATE AppointmentServices SET Status='Confirmed', AssignedDentistUserId, RoomId, DentalChairId
    Svc->>DB: INSERT Notifications (Patient & Dentist) + AuditLogs
    DB-->>MVC: Confirmed

    Note over Rec,DB: Patient Arrives at Clinic Counter on ServiceDate
    Rec->>MVC: POST /Receptionist/Appointments/CheckIn/{id}
    MVC->>API: POST /api/receptionist/appointments/{id}/check-in
    API->>Svc: ReceptionistCheckInAsync(id, recUserId)
    Svc->>DB: Compute MAX(QueueNumber)+1 for ServiceDate (UQ_AppointmentServices_ServiceDate_QueueNumber)
    Svc->>DB: UPDATE Appointments SET Status='CheckedIn', CheckedInAt=SYSDATETIME()
    Svc->>DB: UPDATE AppointmentServices SET Status='CheckedIn', QueueNumber=@nextStt
    DB-->>MVC: QueueNumber issued (e.g. STT #1)